{
  "title": "SequenceStep",
  "description": "A unit of work a sequence can run: an async function of a SequenceContext, or an object with such a `run` method. Whatever it returns, or resolves to, is its result. A step that waits should wait through its context - `wait`, `waitUntil`, `waitFor` or a nested step - so that pausing, cancelling and ending the scene reach it. Awaiting an unrelated promise directly is allowed, but neither pauses nor cancels with the sequence.",
